; Like bean-query, conversions use only a currency pair's own price or its
; inverse: EUR has no price in HOOL or CHF, so it stays unconverted even
; though both connect through USD. A position held at cost also converts
; through its cost currency: GOOG {2 USD} reaches CHF through USD.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Equity:O

2020-01-01 price EUR 2 USD
2020-01-01 price HOOL 5 USD
2020-01-01 price USD 0.9 CHF
2020-01-01 price GOOG 3 USD

2020-01-04 * "x"
  Assets:Cash   2 EUR
  Assets:Cash   3 USD
  Assets:Stock  1 HOOL {4 EUR}
  Assets:Stock  2 GOOG {2 USD}
  Equity:O
